      "description": "Dawcade Instruments brings the synths of Dawcade into one app.\n\n• Digital: FM, Wavetable, Phase Distortion, Vector, Spectral, Chip.\n• Analog: VA, SuperSaw, Voltage, Pad, Noise.\n• Keys: Organ, Electric Piano, Bell.\n• Play the on-screen keyboard with one to three rows, scroll each row and lock it to a scale. Sweep cutoff and resonance on the XY pad, or run the tempo-synced arpeggiator with seven patterns, octave range and note repeat. HOLD keeps notes ringing.\n• Drive, Chorus, Delay and Reverb after every instrument, with a built-in output limiter.\n• Factory presets, your own presets and A/B compare.\n• USB and Bluetooth MIDI keyboards. Record what you play as a 24-bit WAV.\n• Every instrument is also an AUv3 plug-in for other DAWs and music apps.\n\nNo account, no subscription, no ads. Dawcade Instruments does not collect any data.\n\nRequires iOS 17 or later.",
